 "description": "Designers Roberto Biscontini and Lorenzo Argento have created a world of refinement in this 60-footer ocean-cruising yacht.\nWith a hull length of almost 18 metres, the Oceanis Yacht 60 has a remarkable and sophisticated silhouette while preserving its elegant design and excellent marine qualities.\nNew feature: the sailboat now integrates recyclable Elium® resin in its production process. .\nFind out more",
