   "title": "Elium® resin used in sailboat production",
   "intro": "The Oceanis Yacht 60 now integrates Elium® resin, already tried and tested with the First 44, offering an innovative, sustainable solution.\nThis recyclable resin, developed jointly with Arkema, minimises the boat's environmental footprint while still guaranteeing outstanding sailing performance.\nThrough the redesign of its production process, BENETEAU makes the sailboat part of an eco-responsible approach, while preserving the sailing experience and comfort of its leisure boating enthusiasts.",
